(text "64 contacts: 52 MCU signal pads + 2 core 5V feed + 2 core 3V3 reference + CTRL_READY + 7 GND." (at 20.32 116.84 0) (effects (font (size 1.25 1.25)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0956d000-5d70-50bb-9097-8504dba06787"))
(text "All MCU GPIOs are exposed by port name. PG10 stays NRST; PF0/PF1 share optional HSE; PB8 shares BOOT." (at 20.32 132.08 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid "5dbbe30d-b972-52f5-9441-b8d384a10713"))
(text "PC7 is RUN_ARM when plugged into this power base. CTRL_READY = Schmitt-reset-ok AND PC7; default LOW." (at 20.32 147.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid "fded4139-5074-5074-b77f-1ac8836307a7"))
(text "Standalone core: regulated 4.75-5.25V at J101 pins1/3 and GND. Do not parallel independent 5V sources." (at 20.32 162.56 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid "becf43ac-1f2d-59c0-abe4-a4735324ad25"))
(text "3V3 reference is core -> base clamps / fault pull-up / SWD sense only. Never parallel base and core regulators." (at 20.32 177.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ceeaface-a1a4-5e04-94ac-408f92169454"))
(text "Application ABZ / SPI / UART / SWD / CAN / LEDs / ADC filters all reside on the power baseboard." (at 20.32 193.04 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid "9df63f83-80a1-577f-8b71-f24b321a4b38"))
